# HTTP backend snippet. Append to the reverse proxy that sits in front of
# the night calendar and behind the TLS front door. On this fleet that
# proxy is node-primary, and the sheet listens on the nebula address of fly.
# Do not replace a live Caddyfile with this fragment.
#
# Ardra is HTTP only. The TLS front door owns certificates.

http://nightcal.example.org {
	import privacy
	reverse_proxy 10.0.0.6:8765 {
		header_up X-Forwarded-Proto https
	}
}
